http://bioinf.wehi.edu.au/limmaGUI/

so if that's what you are trying to use, then maybe you can 
ignore the warning about ActiveTcl, but it certainly wouldn't 
hurt to install ActiveTcl.

Always trying to improve installation methods, but there are 
various licensing and packaging issues I've had trouble with 
along the way.

Hope this helps,
