Subject: [BioC] new version of globaltest
Message-ID: <D291F33C586C8E48B95C26F8C805513A01397393@mail5.lumc.nl>

Dear all,

Version 2.1.0 of the globaltest package is now available. Globaltest tests
whether the expression profile of a geneset/pathway is associated with a
clinical variable.

Main new features of version 2.1.0:
- The possibility to adjust the test for the presence of confounders or for
other known risk factors. This also allows the test to be used with data
from a more complex research design.
- A new diagnostic plot sampleplot which allows easier assessment of the
influence of individual samples on the test result.
- Inclusion of standard errors in geneplot (geneplot assesses the influence
of individual genes on the test result).

For more information see the pdf included with the package.

Regards,

Jelle Goeman

